      "value": "This would be a good idea. Currently Im always on orange because I have a couple friend groups who wouldnt mix well. But if I can set my join status per friend group that would make it easier to have friends join me and keeping conflicting groups seperate. It would also give an actual purpose to using the existing friend groups feature.",
